WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.675
Link Bootstrap, then style by adding its class names

2
00:00:04.303 --> 00:00:07.228
A plain page, with the browser's own button.

3
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:11.980
Link Bootstrap's stylesheet: CSS that someone else wrote.

4
00:00:12.943 --> 00:00:16.493
Its rules apply at once: the heading's font changes.

5
00:00:17.219 --> 00:00:21.019
Now add two class names: one for the shape, one for the colour.

6
00:00:22.016 --> 00:00:25.841
No CSS of your own. The class names did the styling.
